<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35179" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-lŭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pelluo</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Front. Ep. ad M. Caes. 4</span></i>),
			ŭi, ūtum, 3, v. a.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to wash
			off</i>, <i>to wash bathe</i>, <i>lave</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manus undā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					5, 435</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquid aquā marinā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 20, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aedem madentibus pennis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					10, 44, 61, § 127</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sitientes artus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 120</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sudor perluit ora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 123</span></i>
			.—<i>Pass.</i>, <i>to
				wash one's self</i>, <i>to bathe</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perluitur solitā Titania lympha,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					3, 173</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in fluminibus perluuntur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 6, 20</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 15, 4</span></i> (in
					<i><span class="en">App. M. 2, 30, p. 166</span></i> Oud.,
			read diffluens).</div>
